# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Generated artifacts (regenerated via `bun run gen` / build scripts).
# The Rust generated tree at `crates/pellucid-handlers/src/generated/`
# is committed because `pellucid-codegen` references its
# `.proto.sha256` via `include_str!` at compile time and the workspace
# must build from a clean clone (Railway / CI / fresh dev box) without
# requiring the sebuf plugin on PATH. Re-running `bun run gen` simply
# overwrites the tracked files; `git diff` then surfaces drift.
webview/src/generated/
docs/api/openapi.json

# TypeScript incremental build outputs
*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite-tsbuildinfo/

# Convex generated. Hand-checked-in at T0.9 (the canonical output of
# `bunx convex codegen` against this schema; checked in because convex-test
# requires the directory to exist and we cannot run `convex codegen`
# without a provisioned cloud deployment). Will be regenerated from the
# real deployment at T7.1.
!convex/_generated/

# Profiling / benchmark
flamegraph.svg
perf.data*
*.profraw

# Secrets that must never be committed
*.pem
*.key
!**/test-fixtures/**/*.pem
!**/test-fixtures/**/*.key
secrets/
